 ## Background
-The method was introduced in the context of "Quantile Rendering: Efficiently Embedding High-dimensional Feature on 3D Gaussian Splatting" [S1, unofficial]. It addresses the need to process 3D Gaussian Splatting data with 3D neural networks, which typically operate on voxel grids [S1, unofficial]. The approach was also utilized in GaGS for dynamic scene modeling, where voxelization facilitates the extraction of geometry-aware features for deformation learning [S2].
